flowchart TD
  CALL[Function invoked] --> ARROW{Arrow function?}
  ARROW -->|yes| LEX[Use lexical this\nfrom enclosing scope]
  ARROW -->|no| NEW{Called with new?}
  NEW -->|yes| FRESH[this = new object]
  NEW -->|no| BOUND{bind/call/apply?}
  BOUND -->|yes| CTX[this = specified object]
  BOUND -->|no| METH{Method call obj.f?}
  METH -->|yes| OBJ[this = obj]
  METH -->|no| DEF[Default\nstrict: undefined\nsloppy: global]

